                        .col-sm-8.featured-text.text-lg-left.text-white.custom-text
                            h6.text-white-50 But this PC is for normal Gamers without higher ambitions. It has an all-in-one cpu water-cooling set from ASUS and 32GB RAM, which, in my opinion, should be the standard nowadays :)
                            br
                            h6.text-white-50 To the components:
                            h6.text-white-50 The AMD Ryzen 5 processor forms the powerhouse, ensuring efficient multitasking, responsiveness and seamless performance. Complementing this, the Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro RAM not only enhances speed but adds a dazzling RGB touch, making the system as visually striking as it is powerful.
                            h6.text-white-50 For storage, the SanDisk Extreme Pro M.2 NVMe 3D SSD and the Samsung 860 EVO SSD, both 500GB, provide lightning-fast data access and storage reliability. These drives, paired with the Be Quiet Pure Power 11 400W, offer a robust and quiet power solution.
                            h6.text-white-50 The NZXT H510i white case not only houses these components in style but also provides a smart and efficient layout for optimal airflow. To keep temperatures under control. The CPU and MB temperature is also displayed on an integrated display by the ASUS ROG Ryujin 360 All-in-One CPU liquid cooler. It ensures top-notch cooling performance.
                            br
                            h6.text-white-50 Together, this meticulously chosen combination of components creates a good performance, that not only meets but exceeds expectations in both power and aesthetics.
                            h6.text-white-50 The special feature of the PC is that it only has an integrated graphic card from AMD Radeon, that makes it possible to reduce the price to under 900€ (state: 2022).
                    
